        <mxCell id="noteContinuity" parent="boundary" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;b&gt;Continuity rule&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Future Self remembers the user&#39;s actual dream, obstacles, past wins, actions and previous conversations. Responses must remain specific to the user&#39;s life and preserve continuity across the 90-day journey." vertex="1">
